{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Abrez</strong> is a thrilling arcade game that tests your precision and speed. The principle is simple: shoot at colorful cans moving along a conveyor belt. Some cans increase your score, while others decrease it. By shooting at coins, you can fill your basket to buy special balls: single, triple, or explosive, capable of hitting multiple targets at once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be careful: if too many pyramids or groups of cans reach the end of the conveyor without being hit, <strong>you immediately lose the current level</strong>! Each level lasts 3 minutes, requiring quick thinking, strategy, and sharp aim to achieve the highest scores.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players can <strong>buy</strong> and <strong>sell</strong> their balls to better adapt to each situation and optimize their performance. For added convenience, pressing the <strong>space bar</strong> on the keyboard brings up an image displaying all the main keyboard shortcuts and compatible controller buttons to help you control your game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Finally, a <strong>leaderboard</strong> is automatically updated, showing each player's nickname, avatar, and best score. Challenge your friends, climb to the top of the rankings, and become the master of <strong>Abrez</strong>!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Score > 1000","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3593000/8635fa458d6033834bdf89968b38d06a7d79177b.jpg"},{"name":"Score > 5000","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3593000/9f3ac28b9e93e4f50692c90293a5e40e64fd7e35.jpg"},{"name":"Score > 10000","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3593000/5e46770a61b133a1490c5ebfe625f6739e0c73a7.jpg"},{"name":"Score > 50000","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3593000/591d133efdf6f8c823c622996e91bd30b25d2729.jpg"},{"name":"Score > 100000","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3593000/3061c9dff7929e2c42a7f02b5b9a399e05a30c9f.jpg"},{"name":"Score > 500000","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3593000/859bcdea4a39b4260471ef2657efaad6ed66f89a.jpg"}],"total":6},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3593000?t=1751653920","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3593000?t=1751653920","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593000/ee29a97618af6edbdeab33ddb13c1e3f9017f1cb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751653920","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593000/ee29a97618af6edbdeab33ddb13c1e3f9017f1cb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751653920","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3631210,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Abrez</strong> is a thrilling arcade game that tests your precision and speed. The principle is simple: shoot at colorful cans moving along a conveyor belt. Some cans increase your score, while others decrease it. By shooting at coins, you can fill your basket to buy special balls: single, triple, or explosive, capable of hitting multiple targets at once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be careful: if too many pyramids or groups of cans reach the end of the conveyor without being hit, <strong>you immediately lose the current level</strong>! Each level lasts 3 minutes, requiring quick thinking, strategy, and sharp aim to achieve the highest scores.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players can <strong>buy</strong> and <